<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1039030" n="283r"/>
  <p>Queste due righe saranno per riverir umilmente <choice><abbr>V.</abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S.</abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>
      <lb/>et insieme per darle notizia, che hò fatto consegnare al <rs type="person">Camerie<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re</rs> de’ <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">ri</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1365411982">Ash</rs> e <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509616" type="person">Be<add>rk</add>eley</rs> (li quali sono <date when="1719-05-20">oggi</date> di qui partiti
      <lb/>per ritornarsene à cotesta <choice><abbr>Mag.<hi rend="sup">ca</hi></abbr><expan>Magnifica</expan></choice> Città di <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Padova</rs>)<note type="comment">Der Philosoph George Berkeley und St. George Ashe Jr. befanden sich seit 1716 auf einer ausgedehnten Italienreise. Siehe Tom Jones, George Berkeley. A Philosophical Life, Princeton &amp; Oxford, 2021, p. 253. Laut Jones ist ein Eintrag im Gästebuch der Universität Padua vom 15. Januar der einzige bisher existierende Nachweis von Berkeleys Aufenthalt in Italien in 1719. Somit wäre dieser Brief ein weiterer Beweis.</note> tre esem<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>plari della <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_7XA2T6GU">dissertazione <hi rend="u">de Mercurio lucente in vacuo</hi></rs>, insieme
      <lb/>colle <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_SSNXBWSP">Transazioni Filosofiche</rs>, che il <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs> rimanda
      <lb/>à <choice><abbr>V.</abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S.</abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>. La supplico portare i miei <abbr>ossequios.<hi rend="sup">mi</hi></abbr> rispetti agl’
      <lb break="no"/><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">mi</hi></abbr> <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">ri</hi></abbr> e <choice><abbr>Prni</abbr><expan>Patroni</expan></choice> miei <abbr>stimatiss.<hi rend="sup">mi</hi></abbr><supplied>,</supplied> i <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">ri</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118867865" type="person">Vallisnieri</rs> e <rs key="pers_DE-588-104265264" type="person">Morgagni</rs>,
      <lb/>con consegnare et all’uno et all’altro un esemplare della mentova<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ta <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_7XA2T6GU">dissertazione</rs>, e con river<add>ir</add>li per parte del mio <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Zio</rs>. Frattanto
      <lb/>la continui onorarmi della sua <abbr>pregiatiss.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr> amicizia, e cre<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dermi tal quale io mi dichiaro</p>
  <closer>di <choice><abbr>V.</abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S.</abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill<supplied>.</supplied>ma</abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Div.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Divotissimo</expan></choice> <abbr>Obblig.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> Servo
      <lb/><signed><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">NB.</rs></signed>
      <lb/><dateline><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venezia</rs><supplied>,</supplied> li <date when="1719-05-20">20. Maggio 1719</date>.</dateline></closer>
</div>
